# "Activate only during your turn" (CR 602.5b): on Bot2's turn 2 Bot1 has an untapped Island and Sundial of the Infinite
# but is not offered the ability. On its own turn 3 it is: Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1 in Bot1's main phase, and Bot1
# answers with Sundial. The turn ends (CR 724.1): the Bolt is exiled with the Sundial's ability (724.1b), so Bot1 stays at
# 20, and turn 4 is Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Sundial of the Infinite
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
